      "text": "Problem solving is search through a space of possible states toward a goal. That's the Newell-Simon computational account. Gestalt psychology adds: solving also involves *restructuring* the representation of the problem itself. Expertise research shows that novices search; experts recognize."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-PROBLEM-SOLVING.md#003",
      "path": [
        "05-PROBLEM-SOLVING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
