        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  INITIAL STATE         GOAL STATE\n  +───────────+         +───────────+\n  |  What you |         |  What you |\n  |  start    |         |  want to  |\n  |  with     |         |  reach    |\n  +───────────+         +───────────+\n       |                      |\n       └──────────────────────┘\n            Problem Space:\n       All possible intermediate\n       states reachable by operators"
    },
